        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a219" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts169" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts170">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>*pues** tikalakiliah sepa se: ya n' tein pata:wak,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
